---
// Starts `hidden`; CrtPrefScript's `DOMContentLoaded` handler reveals it once JS has
// actually run, so a no-JS visitor never sees a dead toggle (ticket 11 § Taskbar
// strip). `aria-pressed="true"` matches the script's default-on behaviour; the
// script itself is the source of truth for both the attribute and `data-crt` once
// it runs.
---

<button type="button" data-crt-toggle hidden aria-pressed="true">
  CRT
</button>
